Eh, what do you think? What do you think
my favorite Pokémon is? I might have mentioned it.

173
00:20:21,931 --> 00:20:28,571
何じゃと思う？結構なんかヒトカゲとかリザードンとか言われたけど、何だと思う？
What do you think? People often say Charmander
or Charizard, but what do you think?

174
00:20:30,971 --> 00:20:33,271
メタグロス？強さか？強さか？
