"I'm a father with an only daughter who started working this year. From Mela-chan's talk, I felt your father warmly watches over you while worrying."

1533
02:48:41,986 --> 02:48:45,006
デビューから2週間経ち、何か話したりしましたか？え、めちゃ話すよ。
