I want Onisara to empathize with what I'm about to say.

1593
02:55:54,799 --> 02:55:57,579
あのさ、一番好きな曲って難しくないか？
You know, isn't it hard to pick your absolute favorite song?

1594
02:55:59,019 --> 02:56:01,659
1曲って無理じゃない？
Isn't choosing just one song impossible?

1595
02:56:01,659 --> 02:56:04,239
1曲って無理なのじゃ。なんで無理か？なんで無理か？
Picking just one is impossible. Why is it impossible? Why is it impossible?

1596
